{"html":"<div class=\"product_detail\">\n<div align=\"center\" class=\"pdt_detail_img\">\n<img alt=\"제품 상세 공지(탑) - 온라인 가품 유통 주의 안내\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoopm.com/shop/storage/shop_image/Ww8yREXDVplPHT9vZS1WKnZe1DiprZ143KbzqknD.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div align=\"center\" class=\"pdt_detail_img\" style=\"padding:10px;\"><br/><br/><br/></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pdt_detail_img\">\n<link href=\"https://hangeul.pstatic.net/hangeul_static/css/nanum-myeongjo.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<style type=\"text/css\">@font-face {font-family:'NEXON Lv2 Gothic Light';src:url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/projectnoonnu/noonfonts_20-04@2.1/NEXON Lv2 Gothic Light.woff') format('woff');font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;}\r\n            @font-face {font-family:'NEXON Lv2 Gothic';src:url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/projectnoonnu/noonfonts_20-04@2.1/NEXON Lv2 Gothic.woff') format('woff');font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;}\r\n            .font_NMr {font-family:'NanumMyeongjo' !important;}\r\n            .font_NMb {font-family:'NanumMyeongjoBold' !important;}\r\n            .font_NMeb {font-family:'NanumMyeongjoExtraBold' !important;}\r\n            .font_Noto {font-family:'Noto Sans KR';}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap * {box-sizing:border-box;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:break-word;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap ul, ol, li, dl, dt, dd, p, div, span, section, i, form, fieldset, input, table, tr, th, td, button, textarea, br {margin:0;padding:0;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap i {font-style:normal;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap ul, ol, li, dl, dt, dd {list-style:none;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap img {width:auto;max-width:100%;margin:0 auto;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap {font-family:'NEXON Lv2 Gothic', sans-serif;width:100%;max-width:1200px !important;margin:0 auto;font-size:16px;font-weight:300;letter-spacing:-0.5px;text-align:center;color:#424242;line-height:1.4;}\r\n\r\n            /* 공통 */\r\n            /* 폰트 스타일 */\r\n            .product_detail_wrap p {transform:rotate(0.04deg)}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .p0 {font-size:1.125em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .p1 {font-size:1.5em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .ip1 {font-size:1.5em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .ip2 {font-size:1.75em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .p3 {font-size:2em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .p4 {font-size:3em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .ip4 {font-size:3em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .ip5 {font-size:5em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .fw_600 {font-weight:600;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .fw_700 {font-weight:700;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .lh_10 {line-height:1;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .lh_12 {line-height:1.2;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .tl {text-align:left;}\r\n\r\n            /* 칼라 스타일 */\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .color_white {color:#fff;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .color_dark {color:#121212;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .color_gray {color:#8f96a1;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .color_lightbrown {color:#d6a965;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .color_brown {color:#b56a3f;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .color_darkbrown {color:#4d3a32;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .color_pointbrown {color:#785039;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .bg_gray {background-color:#f9f9f9;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .bg_darkbrown {background-color:#382f2c;}\r\n\r\n            /* 간격 스타일 */\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mg_auto {margin:0 auto;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mt-05em {margin-top:-0.5em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mt_03em {margin-top:0.3em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mt_04em {margin-top:0.4em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mt_08em {margin-top:0.8em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mt_30 {margin-top:30px;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mt_50 {margin-top:50px;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mt_70 {margin-top:70px;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mt_100 {margin-top:100px;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mt_150 {margin-top:150px;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .pd_2em {padding:2em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .plrb_2em {padding: 0 2em 2em;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .pb_80 {padding-bottom:80px;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .pb_100 {padding-bottom:100px;}\r\n\r\n            /* GRID · FLEX 스타일 */\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .grid_2step {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 48%);justify-content:space-between;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .grid_3step {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 30%);justify-content:space-between;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .grid_txtList {display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.8em 1fr;align-items:start;gap:1em 0.5em;text-align:left;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .grid_rg36 {row-gap:36px;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .grid_rg45 {row-gap:45px;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .flex_colum {display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .flex_center {display:flex;align-items:center;}\r\n\r\n            /* 기타 스타일 */\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .w65 {width:65%;margin-left:17.5%;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .w75 {width:75%;margin-left:12.5%;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .w80 {width:80%;margin-left:10%;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .w90 {width:90%;margin-left:5%;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .wMax {width:max-content;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .number_roundbox {display:inline-block;padding:0.5em 0.684em 0.4em;border-radius:150px;background-color:#382f2c;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .bdr_10 {border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .bdr_b10 {border-radius:0 0 10px 10px;overflow:hidden;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .ptr {position:relative;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .ybr {display:none;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mWidth_10 {max-width:10% !important;}\r\n            .product_detail_wrap .mWidth_50 {max-width:50% !important;}\r\n\r\n            /* 키이미지 */\r\n            .product_keyimg .key_txtbox {position:absolute;top:215px;}\r\n\r\n            /* 타이틀 */\r\n            .product_title {margin:150px 0 50px;}\r\n            .product_title img {position:absolute;top:0;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:-1;}\r\n            .product_title .product_name {display:inline-block;font-size:0.75em;}\r\n            .product_title .product_name i {background-color:#fff;padding:0 1em;}\r\n            .product_title .product_name span {font-family:'NanumMyeongjoExtraBold' !important;}\r\n\r\n            /* 핵심 6가지 */\r\n            .main_point {position:absolute;width:75%;top:100px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);}\r\n            .main_point li {border-top:1px solid #382f2c;}\r\n            .main_point .num_box {display:inline-block;padding:20px 26px;}\r\n            .dashed_line {width:0;border-left:1px dashed #382f2c;height:70px;margin:45px auto 50px;}\r\n\r\n            /* 제품특징 01 */\r\n            .ge_grid {position:absolute;width:83.3333%;display:grid;grid-template-columns:3.3333% 1fr 12.7778% 1fr 12.7778% 1fr 12.7778%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;}\r\n            .ge_grid img {max-width:51% !important;}\r\n            .ge_grid_top {top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%, -50%);}\r\n            .ge_grid_bottom {bottom:19%;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);}\r\n            /* 제품특징 02 */\r\n            .bio_ge p {position:absolute;width:28%;height:27.3418%;color:#fff;}\r\n            .bio_ge p span {padding:0 1em;}\r\n            .bio_ge p:nth-of-type(1) {top:0;left:4.6667%;}\r\n            .bio_ge p:nth-of-type(2) {top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);left:0;}\r\n            .bio_ge p:nth-of-type(3) {bottom:0;left:4.6667%;}\r\n            .bio_ge p:nth-of-type(4) {top:0;right:4.6667%;}\r\n            .bio_ge p:nth-of-type(5) {top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);right:0;}\r\n            .bio_ge p:nth-of-type(6) {bottom:0;right:4.6667%;}\r\n            /* 제품특징 03 */\r\n            .ge_cont p {position:absolute;color:#e5d6cd;border:2px dotted #e5d6cd;border-radius:200px;width:17.5926%;height:21.8391%;padding:0.5em 0.5em 0;}\r\n            .ge_cont p:nth-of-type(1) {top:15%;left:20%;transform:translateX(-50%);}\r\n            .ge_cont p:nth-of-type(2) {top:8%;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);}\r\n            .ge_cont p:nth-of-type(3) {top:15%;right:20%;transform:translateX(50%);}\r\n            .ge_stick {padding:10px 0 !important;}\r\n            .ge_stick::after {content:\"\";position:absolute;top:0;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:35%;height:100%;border-left:1px dotted #382f2c;border-right:1px dotted #382f2c;}\r\n            /* 제품특징 04 */\r\n            .research_inst li {min-height:245px;padding:36px 0 !important;}\r\n            .research_inst img {max-width:52% !important;}\r\n            /* 제품특징 06 */\r\n            .tasting_note {border:1px dashed #785039;border-radius:200px;padding:60px 0;}\r\n            .tasting_note .tit_box {position:absolute;top:-0.7em;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);padding:0 0.8em;background-color:#f9f9f9;}\r\n            .tasting_note .left_txt {position:absolute;top:50%;left:0;transform:translate(-100%, -45%);padding-right:0.3em;}\r\n            .tasting_note .right_txt {position:absolute;top:50%;right:0;transform:translate(100%, -45%);padding-left:0.3em}\r\n\r\n            /* 브랜드 스토리 */\r\n            .brand_grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:40% 56%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;border:#e1e1e1 solid 1px;text-align:left;}\r\n            .brand_grid .logo_img {max-width:40% !important;margin-top:1em;}\r\n\r\n            /* 각종인증사항 */\r\n            .certifi_grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:15% 82%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;border:#e1e1e1 solid 1px;}\r\n            .certifi_grid .txt_line {position:relative;}\r\n            .certifi_grid .txt_line:after {content:\"\";width:100%;position:absolute;bottom:-1px;left:0;border-top:1px solid #e1e1e1;}\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:1200px) {\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .ip1 {font-size:2vw;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .ip2 {font-size:2.3333vw;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .ip4 {font-size:4vw;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .ip5 {font-size:6.6667vw;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .mt_30 {margin-top:2.5vw;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .mt_50 {margin-top:4.1667vw;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .mt_70 {margin-top:5.8333vw;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .mt_100 {margin-top:8.3333vw;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .mt_150 {margin-top:12.5vw;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .pb_80 {padding-bottom:6.6667vw;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .pb_100 {padding-bottom:8.3333vw;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .grid_rg36 {row-gap:3vw;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .grid_rg45 {row-gap:3.75vw;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .bdr_10 {border-radius:0.8333vw;}\r\n                .product_keyimg .key_txtbox {top:17.9167vw;}\r\n                .product_title {margin:12.5vw 0 4.1667vw;}\r\n                .main_point {top:8.3333vw;}\r\n                .main_point .num_box {padding:1.6667vw 2.1667vw;}\r\n                .dashed_line {height:6vw;margin:3.75vw auto 4.1667vw;}\r\n                .ge_stick {padding:0.8333vw 0 !important;}\r\n                .research_inst li {min-height:20.4167vw;padding:3vw 0 !important;}\r\n                .tasting_note {padding:5vw 0;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:1080px) {\r\n                .product_detail_wrap {font-size:15px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:960px) {\r\n                .product_detail_wrap {font-size:14px;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .w75 {width:90%;margin-left:5%;}\r\n                .main_point {width:90%;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .ybr {display:block;}\r\n                .product_detail_wrap .nbr {display:none;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:840px) {\r\n                .product_detail_wrap {font-size:13px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:720px) {\r\n                .product_detail_wrap {font-size:12px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:640px) {\r\n                .product_detail_wrap {font-size:11px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:510px) {\r\n                .brand_grid {grid-template-columns:1fr;row-gap:4.1667vw;text-align:center;}\r\n                .brand_grid .logo_img {margin-top:0 !important;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:560px) {\r\n                .product_detail_wrap {font-size:10px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:480px) {\r\n                .product_detail_wrap {font-size:9px;}\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            @media all and (max-width:400px) {\r\n                .product_detail_wrap {font-size:8px;}\r\n            }\r\n</style>\n<div class=\"product_detail_wrap\">\n<section class=\"product_keyimg ptr\">\n<div class=\"key_txtbox w90\">\n<p class=\"ip5 fw_700 color_dark lh_12\">지쿱카페 게르마늄 블랙 커피</p>\n<p class=\"ip2 font_NMr mt_03em\">GCOOP CAFE GERMANIUM BLACK COFFEE</p>\n</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/germanium_black/germanium_black_keyimg.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"color_darkbrown\">\n<p class=\"p1\">세계 최초 유기 게르마늄 (바이오 게르마늄) 커피</p>\n<p class=\"p3 fw_600 mt_03em\">수용성 유기 게르마늄 고함량 “50ug” 함유<br/>\r\n게르마늄 영지버섯 커피</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"dashed_line\"> </div>\n\n<section class=\"ptr\">\n<div class=\"main_point\">\n<p class=\"ip4 color_dark\">지쿱카페 게르마늄 블랙 커피<br/>\n<span class=\"fw_600\">핵심 6가지</span></p>\n<ul class=\"grid_3step grid_rg45 mt_30\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"num_box p1 font_NMb color_white bg_darkbrown lh_10\">1</p>\n<p class=\"ip2 fw_600 mt_08em\">세계 최초 유기 게르마늄<br/>\r\n\t(바이오 게르마늄 커피)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"num_box p1 font_NMb color_white bg_darkbrown lh_10\">2</p>\n<p class=\"ip2 fw_600 mt_08em\">수용성 영지버섯<br/>\r\n\t유기 게르마늄 커피</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"num_box p1 font_NMb color_white bg_darkbrown lh_10\">3</p>\n<p class=\"ip2 fw_600 mt_08em\">영지버섯 게르마늄 50ug,<br/>\r\n\t폴리페놀 230mg,<br/>\r\n\t베타글루칸 730mg</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"num_box p1 font_NMb color_white bg_darkbrown lh_10\">4</p>\n<p class=\"ip2 fw_600 mt_08em\">저온 로스팅 공법 사용</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"num_box p1 font_NMb color_white bg_darkbrown lh_10\">5</p>\n<p class=\"ip2 fw_600 mt_08em\">네슬레 커피 사용</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"num_box p1 font_NMb color_white bg_darkbrown lh_10\">6</p>\n<p class=\"ip2 fw_600 mt_08em\">첨가물 무첨가</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/germanium_black/germanium_black_img_01.jpg\"/></section>\n\n<div class=\"product_title\">\n<div class=\"ptr\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/common_img/product_name_line.jpg\"/>\n<p class=\"product_name font_NMr mt_03em\"><i>GCOOP CAFE</i><br/>\n<span>GERMANIUM BLACK COFFEE</span></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"p4 fw_600 mt_04em color_dark\">제품 특징</p>\n<p class=\"p0 font_NMr mt_03em\">KEY POINT</p>\n</div>\n\n<section class=\"_KeyPoint_01\">\n<div class=\"p4 font_NMr color_white lh_10 number_roundbox\">1</div>\n<p class=\"p4 fw_600 color_dark mt_30\">기적의 원소 게르마늄</p>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_08em\">영지버섯에서 추출한 산소 도우미 유기 게르마늄(바이오 게르마늄)</p>\n<img class=\"mt_50\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/germanium_black/germanium_black_img_02.jpg\"/>\n<div class=\"w90\">\n<p class=\"p4 fw_600 color_dark mt-05em\">게르마늄이란?</p>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_08em\">게르마늄에는 무기 게르마늄, 유기 게르마늄이 있는데,<br/>\r\n무기 게르마늄은 주로 목걸이나 팔찌 등으로 사용됩니다.<br/>\r\n먹을 수 있는 유기게르마늄은 산삼이나 영지버섯 등에 아주 미량 함유된 성분으로,<br class=\"nbr\"/>\r\n면역력 강화와 항암 효과에 좋은 성분이 포함돼 체내에 불필요한 독소, 병원체, 이물질 등을<br class=\"nbr\"/>\r\n대소변 또는 피부 등으로 배출시켜 신진대사를 왕성하게 하고 활력을 증대시키는<br class=\"nbr\"/>\r\n효과가 있는 것으로 알려져 있습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"bdr_10 mt_50 ptr\">\n<ul class=\"ge_grid ge_grid_top\">\n<li> </li>\n<li><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/germanium_black/germanium_black_img_03_01.png\"/>\n<p class=\"p0 fw_600 color_lightbrown mt_03em lh_12\">산소</p>\n</li>\n<li> </li>\n<li><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/germanium_black/germanium_black_img_03_02.png\"/>\n<p class=\"p0 fw_600 color_brown mt_03em lh_12\">세포</p>\n</li>\n<li> </li>\n<li><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/germanium_black/germanium_black_img_03_03.png\"/>\n<p class=\"p0 fw_600 color_darkbrown mt_03em lh_12\">활성산소<br/>\r\n\t독소·노폐물</p>\n</li>\n<li> </li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"ge_grid ge_grid_bottom\">\n<li> </li>\n<li> </li>\n<li class=\"p0 fw_600 color_lightbrown\">공급</li>\n<li> </li>\n<li class=\"p0 fw_600 color_brown\">공급</li>\n<li> </li>\n<li class=\"p0 fw_600 color_darkbrown\">배출</li>\n</ul>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.gcoop.me/storage/global_image/germanium_black/germanium_black_img_03.jpg\"/></div>\n<p class=\"p0 color_gray mt_30\">* 원료적 특성에 한함</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"_KeyPoint_02 w75 mt_100\">\n<div class=\"p4 font_NMr color_white lh_10 number_roundbox\">2</div>\n<p class=\"p4 fw_600 color_dark mt_30\">수용성 유기 게르마늄<br class=\"ybr\"/>\r\n(바이오 게르마늄) 함유</p>\n<p class=\"p1 mt_08em\">미생물 생합성 특허공법으로 개발되어<br class=\"ybr\"/>\r\n안전하고 생체친화력이 뛰어난 유기 게르마늄</p>\n<div class=\"bio_ge mt_50 ptr\">\n<p class=\"p0 fw_600 flex_colum\"><span>신체에 산소공급 증가</span></p>\n<p class=\"p0 fw_600 flex_colum\"><span>해독작용</span></p>\n<p class=